        <mxCell id="text_29" value="&lt;div&gt;C0 imports that violate the strict layer graph (shown as notes, never allowed arrows):&lt;br/&gt;presentation → domain: 12 imports / 7 modules; presentation → data_access: 3 / 2 modules.&lt;br/&gt;data_access → domain: 28 imports / 10 modules (DAO materialisation, enums and rules).&lt;br/&gt;presentation.auth → saigonbite.NAV: 1 root import; 14 bootstrap imports include app.py → create_app.&lt;br/&gt;Flask, SQLite, standard library and other external imports are outside this layer comparison.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=26;fontColor=#202B36;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
